          Taizan-Ryu Self-Defense is a comprehensive self-defense system created by Soke Joe Miller, based on traditional martial arts including Hakkoryu (52 years), Yoshitsune Jujutsu (59 years), Karate, and Judo (20 years). It aims for true self-defense by balancing practical techniques with spiritual growth.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sd-pillars">

        <div class="sd-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sd-pillar-num">01</span>
          <div class="sd-pillar-body">
            <h3><span class="ja">合気柔術の技法</span><span class="en">Aiki-Jujutsu Techniques</span></h3>
            <p class="ja">相手の力を利用し、最小限の力で最大限の効果を引き出す合気柔術の理論を基礎とします。体格差を超えた護身技術を誰でも習得できます。</p>
            <p class="en">Using the opponent's force to draw maximum effect from minimal effort — the principles of Aiki-Jujutsu form the foundation. Anyone can master self-defense techniques that transcend physical size differences.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sd-pillar-num">02</span>
          <div class="sd-pillar-body">
            <h3><span class="ja">実践的な逮捕術</span><span class="en">Practical Arrest Techniques</span></h3>
            <p class="ja">相手を傷つけず、安全に制圧するための逮捕術。警察官・警備員向けに体系化された技術を、一般の方にも分かりやすく指導します。</p>
            <p class="en">Taiho Jutsu for safely restraining without harming the opponent. Techniques systematized for law enforcement and security personnel, taught in an accessible way to the general public.</p>
